\label{P: key mountain part 1} As in the discussion above, let $(\psi_{\nu},g_{\nu})$ be the conical test function together with the function parametrizing its level sets, and let $(\psi_{\nu}^{\epsilon},g_{\nu}^{\epsilon})_{0 < \epsilon < \nu}$ be the perturbed versions.

